{"axes":"world axes when flg_local==0; selected object orientation when flg_local!=0; native transform multiplies by its transpose","camera_semantics":"For all cam_mode declarations this query shifts cam_bodyid spatial motion to the instantaneous cam_xpos and expresses it with cam_xmat. It does not differentiate target/track camera positioning or orientation modes.","mocap_semantics":"No independent mocap trajectory derivative is computed; retain source static-body behavior even if mocap positions were externally changed.","orientation_selector":"flg_local is a required signed C int; zero/nonzero are source branches, not a Python bool-only schema","origin":"Selected native object center from object_types","source":[{"end_line":1372,"end_offset":34787,"line":1317,"path":"/tmp/specola-extraction-20260906/mujoco-address-logical-semantic-inputs/source/3.3.0/src/engine/engine_support.c","sha256":"0a85e97a33bcb2e1f28cbb6bdd1f9430eb72f0a3ce34194931df63e9a65d44d0","start_offset":33238,"verbatim":"void mj_objectAcceleration(const mjModel* m, const mjData* d,
                           int objtype, int objid, mjtNum res[6], int flg_local) {
  int bodyid = 0;
  const mjtNum *pos = 0, *rot = 0;
  mjtNum correction[3], vel[6];

  // body-inertial
  if (objtype == mjOBJ_BODY) {
    bodyid = objid;
    pos = d->xipos+3*objid;
    rot = (flg_local ? d->ximat+9*objid : 0);
  }

  // body-regular
  else if (objtype == mjOBJ_XBODY) {
    bodyid = objid;
    pos = d->xpos+3*objid;
    rot = (flg_local ? d->xmat+9*objid : 0);
  }

  // geom
  else if (objtype == mjOBJ_GEOM) {
    bodyid = m->geom_bodyid[objid];
    pos = d->geom_xpos+3*objid;
